--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library provides the GstNvInferBase base class shared by the DeepStream
inference plugins. It implements the common GstBaseTransform behaviour, the
configuration file and property parsing, and the interaction with the
NvDsInferContext API, so that the video and audio inference plugins only need to
add their format specific handling.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- GStreamer-1.0 Development package
- GStreamer-1.0 Base Plugins Development package

Install using:
   sudo apt-get install libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-dev libgstreamer1.0-dev

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ Set CUDA_VER in the MakeFile as per platform.
  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvdsgst_inferbase.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/

Build this library before building the gst-nvinfer plugin, which links against
it.
